Package: kitsUI
Title: KIT Scale Construction Tool
Version: 0.3.2
Date: 2026-10-30
Authors@R: person("Jie-Wen", "Tsai", email = "tsai.jiewen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: KIT scale construction tool: a Shiny application for the KIT developmental
    scale, built on 'kits': calibrate one wave at a time with the earlier item parameters
    fixed, check items, link cohorts (internal link) and link to the D-score (external link),
    and score children. Launch with \code{run_kitsui()}.
